name: "Large [#70AC30]Darkheartium []Deflecting Wall"
description: '''
A wall made out of [#70AC30]darkheartium, []can be placed on deep liquids, deflects most projectiles, in rare cases, it shoots out lightning when attacked, dealing alot of damage, it's also highly explosive, would not recommend to surround your base with this.
'''
    type: Wall
    placeableLiquid: true
    health: 3400
    size: 2
    baseExplosiveness: 450
    chanceDeflect: 500
    absorbLasers: true
    lightningChance: 0.025
    lightningDamage: 1000
    lightningLength: 85
    status: darkhearts-curse
	requirements: [
		swordium/24
  darkheartium/24
	]
	category: defense
  research: {
    parent: darkheartium-deflecting-wall
